App Name: Magnetic Storm & Weather Radar
Developer: AGT Studio

AGT Studio respects your privacy and is committed to protecting personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how Magnetic Storm & Weather Radar collects, uses, and protects information when you use the application.

1. Information We Collect

The app may collect the following types of information:

Location information (approximate or precise, if enabled by the user)
Used to provide aurora visibility forecasts and location-based weather data.

Device information (such as device model, system version)
Used for app stability and compatibility.

Advertising data
Used to display relevant advertisements via Huawei Ads.

Notification data
Used to deliver geomagnetic storm alerts and weather notifications.

The app does not collect sensitive personal information such as name, phone number, ID number, or contacts.

2. Purpose of Data Use

Collected data is used only for the following purposes:

Providing core app functionality

Displaying space weather, weather forecasts, and air quality data

Delivering alerts and notifications

Advertising and monetization

Improving app performance and stability

3. Data Sharing

Some data may be shared with trusted third-party services strictly for app functionality:

Huawei Ads Kit – advertising services

Map and data providers (such as OpenStreetMap, NOAA, Open-Meteo)

All third-party services comply with applicable data protection regulations.

4. Data Security

AGT Studio takes reasonable technical measures to protect user data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse. Data is processed securely and only for the purposes described in this policy.

5. User Rights

You may:

Disable location access in system settings

Disable notifications in system settings

Stop using the app at any time

6. Children’s Privacy

This app is not directed to children under the age of 13 and does not knowingly collect personal data from children.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page.

